# Source artwork: the logo masters, and the doctor and hospital photographs as
# supplied (~18MB). The web-sized assets built from them already live in
# client/public — these are only needed to re-run `npm run build:logo` and
# `npm run build:images`.
#
# Both patterns are anchored with a leading slash. Unanchored they match at any
# depth, which would take client/public/images out of the deploy along with
# every doctor and hospital photograph the cards load.
/images
